enginespace: third-party notices

enginespace vendors files from kernelspace, in vendor/kernelspace/. This file carries
the notices that come with them, in two sections: kernelspace, and ts-fsrs, whose memory
model one of kernelspace's files transcribes. The licence of enginespace's own code and
content is the owner's decision (O-3) and is not stated here.

============================================================================
kernelspace
============================================================================

The files under vendor/kernelspace/ are copied, byte for byte, from kernelspace at commit
d478f91a0af590f03fcfd76ee73149fa70b28e51 (committed 2026-10-30). The page
vendor/kernelspace/VENDOR.md lists each one with its SHA-256 and the terms it is under.

kernelspace's code, tests, fixtures and configuration are under the MIT License below. It
is vendor/kernelspace/LICENSE, word for word.

