  kernelspace puts under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
- vendor/kernelspace/public/traces/burstgpt-v2-busiest-hour.json and
  burstgpt-v2-busiest-minute.json are slices of BurstGPT v2.0, under CC BY 4.0. They are
  attributed to the BurstGPT authors (KDD 2025) and the HPMLL/BurstGPT project
  (https://github.com/HPMLL/BurstGPT). They are samples with clamped token counts, and the
  README beside them says how each was cut.
- vendor/kernelspace/public/traces/kimi-conversation.json is the first ten minutes of the
  Kimi conversation trace of Mooncake (FAST'25), under the Apache License 2.0. It is
  attributed to the Mooncake authors (https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake), and its
  token counts are scaled and clamped as the README beside it says.
- vendor/kernelspace/src/lib/learner/fsrs.ts and
  vendor/kernelspace/tests/fixtures/fsrs/reference-vectors.json come from ts-fsrs, below.

